# On Workers, unmatched paths are handled by `assets.not_found_handling =
# "single-page-application"` in wrangler.toml, which serves the app shell.
# A `/*` rule here would run BEFORE that and override it.
#
# If you deploy to Cloudflare Pages instead (which has no not_found_handling
# setting), add this line back:
#   /*  /index.html  200
